<%- include('head') %>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="section-index"><span class="index-line"></span> DEMOLITION • EXCAVATION • SITE WORK</div><h1>MAKE WAY<br>FOR <em>WHAT'S</em><br><em>NEXT.</em></h1><p>Residential and commercial demolition, pool removal, excavation and site preparation for projects across the South Shore of Massachusetts.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/contact">REQUEST AN ESTIMATE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/services">EXPLORE SERVICES <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div><div class="hero-trust"><span><b>01</b> SOUTH SHORE FOCUSED</span><span><b>02</b> RESIDENTIAL + COMMERCIAL</span><span><b>03</b> BACKED BY TRAVERS GROUP</span></div></div><div class="hero-side"><div class="hero-side-top">THE WORK<br>BEFORE THE WORK.</div><div class="hero-vertical">SITE PREPARATION / DEMOLITION</div><div class="hero-side-bottom">A DIVISION OF TRAVERS GROUP <span>↗</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="ticker"><div class="wrap"><span>STRUCTURE REMOVAL</span><span class="ticker-star">✳</span><span>POOL DEMOLITION</span><span class="ticker-star">✳</span><span>SITE CLEARING</span><span class="ticker-star">✳</span><span>CONCRETE REMOVAL</span><span class="ticker-star">✳</span><span>EXCAVATION</span></div></section>
<section class="section section-services"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / OUR CAPABILITIES</span><h2>Built to <em>clear the way.</em></h2></div><p>From a backyard pool removal to commercial site preparation, every project begins with a detailed conversation about scope, access, and next steps.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><% services.forEach((s,i)=>{ %><a class="service-tile" href="/services/<%= s.slug %>"><div class="service-top"><span class="tile-number"><%= String(i+1).padStart(2,'0') %> / 06</span><span class="tile-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="tile-graphic graphic-<%=i%6%>"><span class="geo-rect"></span><span class="geo-stripe"></span></div><h3><%= s.name %></h3><p><%= s.intro %></p><span class="tile-link">EXPLORE SERVICE <span>→</span></span></a><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark-panel"><div class="wrap process-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / WHO WE WORK WITH</span><h2>THE RIGHT START<br>FOR A <em>BETTER BUILD.</em></h2><p>Whether you're clearing a lot, removing an unused pool, or planning a commercial renovation, the first step is understanding the work.</p><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/contact">DISCUSS YOUR PROJECT ↗</a></div><div class="audience-list"><div><span>01</span><h3>HOMEOWNERS</h3><p>House, garage, pool, and selective removal inquiries.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>GENERAL CONTRACTORS</h3><p>Jobsite coordination, removal scopes, and site preparation.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>PROPERTY TEAMS</h3><p>Commercial renovations, phased tear-outs, and access planning.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / WHERE WE WORK</span><h2>Focused on the <em>South Shore.</em></h2></div><p>Local project knowledge matters. We start with a manageable set of priority communities and review each project individually.</p></div><div class="town-grid"><% towns.forEach((t,i)=>{ %><a class="town-tile" href="/areas/<%=t.slug%>"><span class="town-index"><%=String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')%></span><strong><%=t.name%></strong><span>MA ↗</span></a><% }) %></div><a href="/areas" class="text-arrow">VIEW ALL SERVICE AREAS <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="section insights-preview"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / FIELD NOTES</span><h2>Know before <em>you dig.</em></h2></div><a href="/insights" class="text-arrow">ALL PLANNING GUIDES <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="article-grid"><% articles.forEach((a,i)=>{ %><a href="/insights/<%=a.slug%>" class="article-card"><div class="article-visual article-visual-<%=i%2%>"><span>FIELD NOTE / <%=String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')%></span><div class="article-shape"></div></div><div class="article-details"><span><%=a.category.toUpperCase()%></span><h3><%=a.title%></h3><p><%=a.summary%></p><span class="read-link">READ GUIDE ↗</span></div></a><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section contact-band"><div class="wrap contact-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">05 / START YOUR PROJECT</span><h2>Ready to <em>move forward?</em></h2><p>Tell us what you want removed and where the project is located. Our team will review the information and follow up.</p><a class="large-phone" href="<%=phoneLink%>"><%=phone%> ↗</a></div><%- include('form') %></div></section>
</main><%- include('footer') %>
